From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 14:49:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Open the menu with Options on the PS5

The PS5's SDL passes no Create (back) button to a game, which left the
controller no way to press Escape: Options, start to SDL, presses
Escape instead of Return there.
---
 common/wwkeyboard_sdl2.cpp | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/common/wwkeyboard_sdl2.cpp b/common/wwkeyboard_sdl2.cpp
index 30f1745..3bb0d87 100644
--- a/common/wwkeyboard_sdl2.cpp
+++ b/common/wwkeyboard_sdl2.cpp
@@ -264,7 +264,14 @@ void WWKeyboardClassSDL2::Handle_Controller_Button_Event(const SDL_ControllerBut
         break;
     case SDL_CONTROLLER_BUTTON_START:
         keyboardPress = true;
+#ifdef __PROSPERO__
+        /*
+        ** The PS5 passes no Create button to a game, so Options opens the menu.
+        */
+        scancode = SDL_SCANCODE_ESCAPE;
+#else
         scancode = SDL_SCANCODE_RETURN;
+#endif
         break;
     case SDL_CONTROLLER_BUTTON_LEFTSHOULDER:
         keyboardPress = true;
